{"Data":{"Sdk":{"Events":[{"Id":"15276474981","Type":"IssuesEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-18T07:50:18","Actor":"m-gallesio","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"opened","RelatedUrl":"https://github.com/dotnet/Open-XML-SDK/issues/2145","RelatedDescription":"Opened issue \"Provide a way to describe the root element of a VML part\" (#2145) at dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","RelatedBody":"The SDK provides classes which map to VML elements, but there does not seem a way to describe the **root element** of a VML drawing part. Unlike other kinds of parts it is a simply named `<xml>`.\n\nMoreover, I tried loading a XLSX file containing a VML part (in particular a picture in the document heading), but the `RootElement` of the `VmlDrawingPart` is null:\n\n```csharp\nusing DocumentFormat.OpenXml.Packaging;\nusing System.Linq;\n\nusing var document = SpreadsheetDocument.Open(@\"c:\\path\\to\\file.xlsx\", true);\nvar vmlRoot = document.WorkbookPart.WorksheetParts.SelectMany(d => d.VmlDrawingParts).FirstOrDefault(p => p != null)?.RootElement; // is null\n```\n\nI know VML is a legacy format, but since it is still apparently in use there should be a way to handle it via the SDK.\n\nSome cases I found:\n- pictures in the header / footer of a XLSX document\n- comments in a XLSX document (see also https://github.com/dotnet/Open-XML-SDK/issues/1549)"},{"Id":"15172537891","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-16T19:58:27","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"labeled","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":null,"RelatedBody":null},{"Id":"15172537760","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-16T19:58:27","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"labeled","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":null,"RelatedBody":null},{"Id":"15172536782","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-16T19:58:27","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"opened","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":"Opened pull request \"\" (#2144) at dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","RelatedBody":null},{"Id":"15095792514","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-15T19:22:00","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"closed","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":null,"RelatedBody":null},{"Id":"15020406076","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-14T19:50:13","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"labeled","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":null,"RelatedBody":null},{"Id":"15020405208","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-14T19:50:12","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"opened","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":"Opened pull request \"\" (#2143) at dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","RelatedBody":null},{"Id":"15020404917","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-14T19:50:12","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"labeled","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":null,"RelatedBody":null},{"Id":"15020404738","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-14T19:50:12","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"labeled","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":null,"RelatedBody":null},{"Id":"14883675163","Type":"PullRequestEvent","CreatedAt":"2026-09-11T19:22:02","Actor":"dependabot[bot]","Repository":"dotnet/Open-XML-SDK","Organization":"dotnet","RawContent":null,"RelatedAction":"closed","RelatedUrl":null,"RelatedDescription":null,"RelatedBody":null}],"ResultType":"GitHubEvent"}},"RunOn":"20